  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Hello! I am May. I am eight. Today I am at a new school. This is my brother. His name is Pat. He is five. This is my father. He has a blue bag. \"Bye, May!\" says my father.",
      "I am in the classroom. It is big. Teacher Kim says, \"Hello, May!\" \"Find a friend,\" she says. \"Here is an example.\" \"This is Lily.\" \"She is seven.\" I look at the children. Who is my friend?",
      "I find an eraser on the floor. It is red. \"Whose eraser is this?\" I ask. \"It is mine,\" says a girl. \"I am Lily.\" \"I am seven.\" \"I am May,\" I say. Lily smiles. \"This is Lily,\" I tell Teacher Kim. \"She is seven.\" \"Good example!\" says Teacher Kim. Now I have a friend."
    ],
    "summary": "May is new at school. She tells us about her family, finds a red eraser on the floor, and makes a friend.",
